   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Problem 2 - Find 1st and Second Derivatives*)\r\n\r\n(*Create the function f(t)*)\r\nf[t] := \\[Alpha]*Log[a*t]*Cos[\\[Omega]*t]*Sin[\\[Omega]*t]\r\n\r\n(*Call First Derivative*)\r\nD[f[t], t]\r\n\r\n(*Call Second Derivative*)\r\nD[f[t], {t, 2}]\r\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
