   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*Problem 3 - Find Derivative to Arbitrary Function w(x)*)\r\n\r\n(*Create w(x)*)\r\nClear[f]\r\nw[x] := f[x]*g[x]*h[x]\r\n\r\n(*Call 1st Derivative*)\r\nD[w[x], x]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
