  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*Problem 4 - Solve Equation of Motion*)\r\n\r\n(*Initialize Omega, l, g*)\r\nClearAll[\"Global`*\"]\r\n\\[Omega]0 = Sqrt[(g/l)]\r\nl = 10\r\ng = 980\r\n\r\n(*Call NDSolve[]*)\r\nsol = NDSolve[\r\n  {\\[Phi]''[t] == -\\[Omega]0^2 Sin[\\[Phi][t]],\r\n   \\[Phi]'[0] == 0,\r\n   \\[Phi][0] == 30 Degree},\r\n  \\[Phi], {t, 0, 2}]\r\n\r\nPlot[Evaluate[\\[Phi][t] /. sol], {t, 0, 2},\r\n  AxesLabel -> {\"t (s)\", \"\\[Phi] (rad)\"},\r\n  PlotLabel -> \"Pendulum, \\[Phi]0 = 30\\[Degree]\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
